### Get all users

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users

### Get user by uuid (Triss)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/d1edfd91-3bf6-451b-8cfd-fed9b23f3278

### Get user avatar (Triss - seeded on startup)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/d1edfd91-3bf6-451b-8cfd-fed9b23f3278/avatar

### Create avatar that already exists (409) - Triss already has one from seed data

POST http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/d1edfd91-3bf6-451b-8cfd-fed9b23f3278/avatar
Content-Type: image/png

< ./src/main/resources/assets/triss.png

### Delete avatar (Geralt)

DELETE http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/f4274889-1f42-4ac2-abf5-a6a7e53234fc/avatar

### Get deleted avatar (404)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/f4274889-1f42-4ac2-abf5-a6a7e53234fc/avatar

### Create user avatar (201) - Geralt

POST http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/f4274889-1f42-4ac2-abf5-a6a7e53234fc/avatar
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./src/main/resources/assets/geralt.jpg

