### Delete avatar - Geralt

DELETE http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/f4274889-1f42-4ac2-abf5-a6a7e53234fc/avatar

### Get non-existing user (404)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get user with invalid uuid (400)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/users/abc

